Biff Stud importer adventurer~
Biff Stud~
Biff Stud, renowned for his wide travels, is here.
~
His hands are large, and the rest of his body is nearly as
developed. He is scarred on most of his visible skin, surely
caused by run-ins with entire hostile armies. His thick
beard is probably there to hide even more scarring on his
face. Despite his rough treatment, Biff appears to reamain
a relatively jovial person.
~
